{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf0d Year 2155 \u2014 The World After the Fall</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the nuclear war, Earth lies in ruins.<br>Toxic leaks and radioactive storms have turned entire regions into forbidden wastelands.<br>Among the survivors, many have mutated \u2014 losing their sanity, their humanity\u2026 and becoming something else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126270/extras/9bff7e8152125c62928b9e3d24bb9c84.poster.avif?t=1762419828\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126270/extras/9bff7e8152125c62928b9e3d24bb9c84.webm?t=1762419828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddecHumanity\u2019s Last Line of Defense</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only a few safe zones remain across three continents.<br>You are a member of the <strong>Mutant Detection Unit (M.D.U.)</strong>, humanity\u2019s final safeguard.<br>Your duty: <strong>inspect every entrant</strong> from the contaminated zones \u2014<br>verify their identity, observe their behavior, and decide who may pass.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126270/extras/7f3fd57ed405ee344209671aece7282c.poster.avif?t=1762419828\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126270/extras/7f3fd57ed405ee344209671aece7282c.webm?t=1762419828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126270/extras/7f3fd57ed405ee344209671aece7282c.mp4?t=1762419828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd0eAttention to Detail Means Survival</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day, new faces arrive \u2014 desperate, wounded, terrified.<br>But one wrong call could unleash a monster inside the walls.<br>Scrutinize every clue. Spot the inconsistencies.<br>Because in this world, <strong>a single mistake can doom an entire colony.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126270/extras/519f96c73b232f0946737003a706eb66.poster.avif?t=1762419828\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126270/extras/519f96c73b232f0946737003a706eb66.webm?t=1762419828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126270/extras/519f96c73b232f0946737003a706eb66.mp4?t=1762419828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u26a0\ufe0fOne Job. Infinite Consequences.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s not just about who enters \u2014<br>It\u2019s about who <strong>you</strong> trust.<br>Your judgment defines humanity\u2019s future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126270/extras/ceb8209ec0fb9164bc4c8f47c3297908.poster.avif?t=1762419828\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126270/extras/ceb8209ec0fb9164bc4c8f47c3297908.webm?t=1762419828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126270/extras/ceb8209ec0fb9164bc4c8f47c3297908.mp4?t=1762419828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde0Do You Have What It Takes?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the <strong>Mutant Detection Unit</strong> and help protect the last bastions of civilization.<br>The fate of mankind rests in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126270/extras/e61e4a9a1f4e3b1609941fa96eadc7ea.poster.avif?t=1762419828\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126270/extras/e61e4a9a1f4e3b1609941fa96eadc7ea.webm?t=1762419828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126270/extras/e61e4a9a1f4e3b1609941fa96eadc7ea.mp4?t=1762419828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4126270?t=1762419828","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4126270?t=1762419828","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126270/f100812018021e4c4b8d6805c169e50289f4257e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762419828","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126270/f100812018021e4c4b8d6805c169e50289f4257e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762419828","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf0d Year 2155 \u2014 The World After the Fall</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the nuclear war, Earth lies in ruins.<br>Toxic leaks and radioactive storms have turned entire regions into forbidden wastelands.<br>Among the survivors, many have mutated \u2014 losing their sanity, their humanity\u2026 and becoming something else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\